2. Patients undergoing treatment for intraperitoneal malignant ascites, including therapeutic paracentesis;
3. Systemic or other treatments that have a significant impact on the evaluation of efficacy are determined according to the study;
4. Patients with extensive liver metastases Patients with extensive liver metastases (tumor volume occupying approximately \>70% of total liver volume);
